%% Sequence: login dashboard (V3-FR01)
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Browser
    participant BFF as Next.js BFF
    participant API as Flask
    participant DB as SQLite
    U->>BFF: POST /api/auth/login {username, password}
    BFF->>API: POST /api/auth/login
    API->>DB: SELECT user by username
    DB-->>API: user + password_hash
    API->>API: bcrypt.checkpw()
    alt cocok
        API->>API: session[user_id], csrf_token
        API-->>BFF: 200 {user, csrf_token} + Set-Cookie
        BFF-->>U: 200 + cookie
    else salah
        API-->>BFF: 401 {error}
        BFF-->>U: 401
    end
